# No TMDB key here on purpose - the backend hides all external APIs (ADR-0003).
#
# Requests now go through Vite's dev proxy (`/api` → http://localhost:4000/api)
# so the browser talks same-origin and CORS is a non-issue regardless of which
# port Vite auto-picks when 8080 is busy.
#
# Set this to an absolute URL (e.g. http://localhost:4000) only if you want the
# browser to hit the backend directly and have added your frontend origin to
# the backend's ALLOWED_ORIGINS list.
VITE_API_URL=
